    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d806">

                <pb facs="0705" n="695" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.5193/6–749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister-Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Clark</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Canton</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-06-07T17:00:00+08:00">June 7, 1949—5 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received June 8—12:07 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 545. French Counselor has instructions remove to Hong Kong when requested
                    follow government, Cantel 512, June 1, repeated Nanking <pb facs="0706" n="696"
                        xml:id="pg696"/> 349, Shanghai 300; but French still intend send subordinate
                    diplomatic officer Chungking, They apparently feel such action will ease blow to
                    National Government and also permit handling some delicate problems re
                    Indochina.</p>
                <p>Italian Counselor has received instructions detail consular representatives
                    Chungking. Portuguese has recommended he withdraw to Macao when requested move
                    and says he will do so unless otherwise directed [by] Lisbon. He anticipates he
                    will move Macao.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Nanking 369, Shanghai 315.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clark</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
